          "text": " MUKAMA ow'amahe, Ruhanga wa Israeli, agizire ati: Niinyija kufubira Amoni owa Tebesi, Faraho, Misri, baaruhanga baayo, abagabe baayo n'abarikwesiga Faraho boona. ",
